{
  "version": "Notebook/1.0",
  "isLocked": false,
  "fallbackResourceIds": [
    "__MODEL_ACCOUNT_RESOURCE_ID__"
  ],
  "items": [
    {
      "type": 1,
      "name": "intro",
      "content": {
        "json": "## Foundry Model Volume, Latency & Availability\nCompare the selected estate first, sort resource/deployment signals to identify outliers, then investigate one resource below. Missing samples are not zero traffic, zero errors, or perfect availability. Platform metrics require no diagnostic export or agent traces."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 9,
      "name": "parameters",
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
        "crossComponentResources": [
          "value::selected"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "id": "Subscriptions",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "Subscriptions",
            "type": 6,
            "label": "Subscriptions",
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "'",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "value": [
              "/subscriptions/__MODEL_ACCOUNT_SUBSCRIPTION_ID__"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "FoundryResources",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "FoundryResources",
            "type": 5,
            "label": "Compare accounts",
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "'",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "value": [
              "value::all"
            ],
            "query": "resources | where subscriptionId in~ ({Subscriptions}) or strcat('/subscriptions/', subscriptionId) in~ ({Subscriptions}) | where type =~ 'microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts' and kind in~ ('AIServices', 'OpenAI') | project value=id, label=strcat(name, ' (', resourceGroup, ')'), selected=false, group=subscriptionId",
            "crossComponentResources": [
              "{Subscriptions}"
            ],
            "queryType": 1,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "showDefault": false
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "signals-time",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "TimeRange",
            "type": 4,
            "isRequired": true,
            "value": {
              "durationMs": 86400000
            },
            "typeSettings": {
              "selectableValues": [
                {
                  "durationMs": 3600000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 86400000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 604800000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 2592000000
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "signals-latency-metric",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "LatencyMetric",
            "label": "Latency metric",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "value": "TimeToResponse",
            "jsonData": "[{\"value\":\"TimeToResponse\",\"label\":\"Foundry Models - time to response (PTU)\"},{\"value\":\"AzureOpenAITimeToResponse\",\"label\":\"Azure OpenAI - time to response (PTU and pay-as-you-go)\"}]"
          }
        ],
        "style": "pills",
        "queryType": 1,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "name": "scope-notes",
      "content": {
        "json": "### Subscription comparison and account drilldown\n**Compare accounts: All** includes all eligible discovered accounts in the explicitly selected subscriptions, including new accounts on scope refresh. Choose a manual subset to filter comparison; return to **All** for broad scope. **Investigate resource** below never narrows the overview. Changing comparison scope removes out-of-scope detail selections.\n\nOnly RBAC-accessible accounts are discoverable. Queries request up to **1,000 series per resource/metric**; this is a cap, not proof of complete results. Discovery and grids also have limits; reduce scope/range for large estates. Blank cells/no data are not healthy zeroes; query errors must be investigated."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "name": "comparison-label",
      "content": {
        "json": "### Compare the estate\nSort resource values to identify outliers, then investigate a resource below. Resource links use full IDs; hover for subscription/resource-group context when names collide. Missing values remain unavailable. No statistical anomaly detector or averages-of-averages across resources are used."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 10,
      "name": "resource-comparison",
      "content": {
        "version": "MetricsItem/2.0",
        "chartId": "admin-resource-comparison",
        "size": 0,
        "chartType": 0,
        "gridFormatType": 2,
        "resourceLimit": 10000,
        "resourceIds": [
          "{FoundryResources}"
        ],
        "resourceType": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts",
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "timeGrain": "FULL",
        "metrics": [
          {
            "namespace": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts",
            "metric": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts--ModelRequests",
            "aggregation": 1,
            "splitByLimit": 1000
          },
          {
            "namespace": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts",
            "metric": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts--ModelAvailabilityRate",
            "aggregation": 4,
            "splitByLimit": 1000
          },
          {
            "namespace": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts",
            "metric": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts--{LatencyMetric}",
            "aggregation": 4,
            "splitByLimit": 1000
          }
        ],
        "title": "Resource Comparison",
        "gridSettings": {
          "formatters": [
            {
              "columnMatch": "Name",
              "formatter": 13,
              "formatOptions": {
                "showIcon": false
              }
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "Subscription",
              "formatter": 13,
              "formatOptions": {
                "showIcon": false
              }
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "Segment",
              "formatter": 5
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts--ModelRequests",
              "formatter": 1
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts--ModelRequests Timeline",
              "formatter": 5
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts--ModelAvailabilityRate",
              "formatter": 1
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts--ModelAvailabilityRate Timeline",
              "formatter": 5
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts--{LatencyMetric}",
              "formatter": 1
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts--{LatencyMetric} Timeline",
              "formatter": 5
            }
          ],
          "labelSettings": [
            {
              "columnId": "Subscription",
              "label": "Subscription"
            },
            {
              "columnId": "Name",
              "label": "Resource"
            },
            {
              "columnId": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts--ModelRequests",
              "label": "Requests"
            },
            {
              "columnId": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts--ModelAvailabilityRate",
              "label": "Reported availability (%)"
            },
            {
              "columnId": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts--{LatencyMetric}",
              "label": "First-response latency (ms)"
            }
          ],
          "rowLimit": 10000,
          "filter": true
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "name": "deployment-comparison-label",
      "content": {
        "json": "### Compare resource/deployment signals\nEach row retains account identity and the reported deployment dimension. Availability is 5xx-only, not a 4xx/429 SLO. Latency is first response, not completion or p95. Blank rows do not establish healthy zeroes."
      }
    },
